# Playwright E2E (Brave Beta)

Details: [tests/e2e/README.md](tests/e2e/README.md) and [AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md) (E2E section).

## Non-negotiables

- Tests use **system Brave Beta** via `playwright.brave.ts` / `executablePath` — **not** Playwright-downloaded Chromium.
- **Do not** run `pnpm exec playwright install chromium`.
- Headed / UI runs: `pnpm test:e2e:headed`, `pnpm test:e2e:ui` (Brave via `scripts/playwright-ui-brave.mjs`).
- Override browser path with `BRAVE_BETA_PATH` when needed.
